WEBVTT

00:28.760 --> 00:33.560
Everyone says
that friendship is a valuable thing.

00:34.560 --> 00:39.880
And it's even more precious when people
from different classes form friendships.

00:41.040 --> 00:46.960
However, how high can the price
of friendship really be?

02:24.440 --> 02:29.800
THREE MONTHS EARLIER

03:32.960 --> 03:33.800
Come on.

03:44.840 --> 03:46.120
Here, Yuri.

03:46.600 --> 03:49.720
Just throw your bag away.
You see how old and crappy it is?

03:51.920 --> 03:56.480
Really? I can't accept that.
You already bought me ice cream yesterday.

03:56.560 --> 03:59.680
Come on. It's no big deal.
Your bag is so shitty.

03:59.760 --> 04:00.600
Just take this one.

04:00.680 --> 04:01.520
Hm?

04:03.840 --> 04:05.600
You need it if you're gonna
hang out with us.

04:08.280 --> 04:09.240
Hmm.

04:14.280 --> 04:17.280
Why don't Nana and Tubtim
hang out with the rich kids?

04:17.360 --> 04:18.920
And getting a free bag from them…

04:19.000 --> 04:22.360
-Doesn't Yuri feel like a charity case?
-I know. I know.

04:22.440 --> 04:24.760
I would be embarrassed
living off my friends like that.

04:28.880 --> 04:30.520
What the fuck did you say?

04:30.600 --> 04:32.280
Apologize to Yuri right now.

04:35.400 --> 04:38.080
Yuri, if you hear that kind of talk again,

04:38.640 --> 04:39.760
you let us know.

04:40.440 --> 04:42.240
Those girls are so stupid.

04:44.560 --> 04:45.640
Come on.

05:23.160 --> 05:24.280
Excuse me.

05:25.200 --> 05:27.560
My friends and I always sit here.

05:29.960 --> 05:34.120
One, two, three, four.

05:35.160 --> 05:38.920
One, two, three.

05:39.000 --> 05:40.280
Looks like there's one seat left.

05:40.360 --> 05:43.000
We sit here just the three of us.
We need all the space.

05:43.080 --> 05:45.120
Really? What do you mean?

05:45.200 --> 05:48.240
Eh… Nana and Tubtim
need space for their bags.

05:49.000 --> 05:50.440
Mm…

05:51.320 --> 05:52.440
Too bad.

05:54.040 --> 05:58.040
Then, where will a new kid like me sit?
There aren't any seats left.

05:58.120 --> 05:59.720
Sure, there are.

06:01.480 --> 06:02.640
But no.

06:02.720 --> 06:03.960
There aren't any seats for me

06:04.040 --> 06:06.280
because no one wants to let
a new kid into their group.

06:07.120 --> 06:10.080
But you three aren't like that.
You aren't like the rest of them.

06:10.720 --> 06:15.400
Your friendship isn't about class
or even about money,

06:15.480 --> 06:17.600
and you probably wouldn't mind a new face.

06:18.160 --> 06:19.080
Is that right?

06:37.360 --> 06:40.120
Nanno, you're really new here?

06:40.200 --> 06:41.440
Mm.

06:42.000 --> 06:45.520
I'm the new kid. Nice to meet you.

06:47.760 --> 06:49.120
You should know

06:49.200 --> 06:53.840
that we don't usually let
random people join our clique.

06:54.800 --> 06:56.360
But I see that you're new here,

06:57.320 --> 06:59.120
so I'll give you a chance, okay?

06:59.200 --> 07:00.480
Yeah?

07:01.480 --> 07:03.040
If you want to join our clique,

07:03.120 --> 07:06.240
you have to give us proof
that you can be a true friend.

07:06.320 --> 07:08.120
A true friend?

07:08.920 --> 07:10.840
I'm nothing if not a true friend.

07:11.600 --> 07:13.120
Show me then.

07:13.200 --> 07:17.200
I wanna see how you think
a true friend should treat her friends.

07:19.080 --> 07:21.040
Of course, bestie.

07:29.320 --> 07:30.200
Uh…

07:58.840 --> 08:01.760
Nana, here are the answers.

08:21.960 --> 08:24.440
Listen to me, don't do that again.

08:25.160 --> 08:27.360
Our clique doesn't do stuff like that.

08:28.400 --> 08:33.520
But I thought that friends are supposed
to help each other with everything.

08:33.600 --> 08:35.400
But you almost got us in trouble.

08:36.800 --> 08:37.720
Mm.

08:38.320 --> 08:39.560
I understand.

08:42.040 --> 08:43.720
I'm really hungry now.

08:44.880 --> 08:47.160
My hands are sore
from shading in those answers.

08:47.240 --> 08:50.600
I know. My hands are so sore.
I'm so tired.

08:53.680 --> 08:57.000
What do you two want to eat for lunch?
I can go buy it for you.

08:57.080 --> 08:58.880
-Hainanese chicken.
-Me too.

09:00.720 --> 09:03.440
Here. Take the money. My treat.

09:06.840 --> 09:07.840
Mm.

09:07.920 --> 09:08.960
Thanks a lot.

09:19.600 --> 09:20.720
Mm!

09:31.000 --> 09:32.000
Yuri…

09:32.080 --> 09:34.600
-Hm?
-I want the same sauce that Tubtim got.

09:36.240 --> 09:37.800
Okay. I'll get you another one.

09:37.880 --> 09:38.800
Thanks.

09:40.000 --> 09:43.560
I'm sorry, Yuri. Why doesn't my soup
have any squash?

09:45.760 --> 09:47.080
I'll go get you a new one.

09:48.560 --> 09:50.480
Okay. Thank you.

09:59.840 --> 10:01.000
Finally.

10:06.800 --> 10:09.800
Yuri, I don't eat cucumbers.

10:10.360 --> 10:11.600
Do you want them?

10:15.200 --> 10:17.000
You can put them on my plate.

10:18.320 --> 10:19.520
Here you go.

10:21.680 --> 10:22.560
They're all yours.

11:32.600 --> 11:35.800
I can't believe she would dare
show her face here again.

11:35.880 --> 11:37.000
What's the matter?

11:37.560 --> 11:38.920
That's Meen.

11:39.000 --> 11:40.920
She flirted with Nana's boyfriend.

11:41.960 --> 11:43.640
Yuri was so angry at her,

11:44.160 --> 11:46.720
she created a fake Instagram account
to trash her.

11:47.720 --> 11:49.080
Yuri, you're so sneaky.

11:50.600 --> 11:52.480
Meen seems so scared of you guys.

11:56.360 --> 11:57.680
Yuri, thanks so much.

11:58.240 --> 12:01.000
I wouldn't know what to do without you.
You're so naughty.

12:01.560 --> 12:04.240
That's right. I never would've
passed without your notes.

12:04.320 --> 12:05.400
And Yuri,

12:05.480 --> 12:07.480
she's good at predicting questions.

12:07.560 --> 12:10.360
Come on, let's go over our answers.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.640
One, two, three.

12:11.720 --> 12:14.840
Three, four, two,
two, one, two, three, one, four…

12:14.920 --> 12:16.400
-…one.
-…two.

12:21.400 --> 12:23.360
Did you get one for the last question?

12:23.440 --> 12:25.600
Mm-hmm. I got number one too.

12:35.040 --> 12:37.120
I wish I could change my answer.

12:52.800 --> 12:55.080
That's easy, let me help you.

12:55.160 --> 12:57.560
True friends help each other
with everything.

12:57.640 --> 12:59.080
I can do it. No problem.

13:40.200 --> 13:43.520
Now then,
have I done enough to earn a spot?

13:56.320 --> 13:58.080
Bye-bye, see you guys later.

14:49.320 --> 14:53.560
So, your idea of being a true friend
is to act like a servant?

14:54.320 --> 14:57.000
What do you mean? Who's a servant?

14:57.080 --> 14:58.600
They're my friends.

14:58.680 --> 15:00.280
Are you a friend

15:00.360 --> 15:02.760
who does everything for them

15:03.600 --> 15:05.600
and gives them notes for the exams?

15:05.680 --> 15:08.840
A friend who created an account
to bash their enemies.

15:08.920 --> 15:11.240
A friend who help them cheat on a test.

15:11.320 --> 15:13.520
All of that in exchange for money.

15:13.600 --> 15:15.400
Isn't that like a job?

15:18.400 --> 15:23.680
"Here's the money for changing
the test answer. XOXO, Nana."

15:26.360 --> 15:28.000
Don't act so innocent, Yuri.

15:29.880 --> 15:33.600
I know your game. You were acting quiet.

15:34.080 --> 15:36.320
You were trying to up your price,

15:37.320 --> 15:39.000
and then you got upset…

15:40.320 --> 15:42.000
when I beat you to it.

15:58.880 --> 15:59.800
What about it?

16:00.680 --> 16:01.840
What's wrong with that?

16:02.640 --> 16:04.560
I'm just doing my job, you get it?

16:05.400 --> 16:07.360
I play my part and they push me around.

16:09.880 --> 16:11.640
It's not easy to find a job,

16:11.720 --> 16:13.200
and this one pays well.

16:17.360 --> 16:19.600
Yuri, you're quite an interesting girl.

16:21.040 --> 16:22.760
I'm not that interesting.

16:24.600 --> 16:26.120
Tell me something,

16:26.200 --> 16:28.480
is money really that important to you?

16:39.280 --> 16:40.280
Yes, it is.

17:08.240 --> 17:10.000
Hi, mom. I'm home.

17:12.560 --> 17:14.440
I'm Nanno, Yuri's friend. Hi.

17:14.520 --> 17:15.600
Hello.

17:16.280 --> 17:17.600
I hope I'm not a bother.

17:17.680 --> 17:21.000
Have you girls eaten?
I made stir-fried pork and basil.

17:21.080 --> 17:22.240
I'll eat it later.

17:24.640 --> 17:26.000
I bought you a new phone.

17:28.640 --> 17:31.680
Isn't this too expensive?
Where did you get the money?

17:31.760 --> 17:35.080
Hmm. My friends paid me
to help tutor them.

17:39.360 --> 17:41.200
Mom, come on.
Let me show you how to use it.

17:42.360 --> 17:43.360
Here.

17:44.480 --> 17:46.720
-Uh, isn't it nice?
-Mm-hmm.

17:46.800 --> 17:49.240
This is the newest model
they have in the store.

17:49.320 --> 17:51.440
You don't have to watch your shows
on the TV.

17:51.520 --> 17:53.400
Now, you can watch things on this.

17:54.000 --> 17:55.640
You won't get lonely when I'm not here.

17:57.520 --> 17:59.560
You've got such nice friends.

18:02.720 --> 18:04.880
Hey, let's finally take
our first picture together.

18:04.960 --> 18:07.720
Come on. Cheese.

18:08.240 --> 18:09.480
How do I do that?

18:10.120 --> 18:11.640
-So, when you take the picture…
-Uh-huh.

18:11.720 --> 18:14.240
…and you can send it to me like this.

18:14.320 --> 18:16.600
I do wanna have some real friends.

18:19.800 --> 18:21.440
But this is where I live.

18:22.920 --> 18:24.440
My family is poor.

18:27.080 --> 18:30.400
If I didn't do what they want,
how else can I have a better life?

18:33.960 --> 18:37.360
They just treat me the way rich people
always treat poor people.

18:40.320 --> 18:42.920
They treat poor people
like we're a charity case.

18:44.720 --> 18:46.240
They throw scraps our way…

18:48.480 --> 18:50.920
but it's just to make themselves
feel generous.

18:54.760 --> 18:58.080
But they never really accept us,
poor people, as being like them.

19:04.640 --> 19:07.080
Nana and Tubtim are like most rich people.

19:10.680 --> 19:13.360
When I first started hanging out
with the two of them,

19:14.600 --> 19:16.720
I thought I had friends I could depend on.

19:23.280 --> 19:25.040
I imagined what it would be like

19:26.160 --> 19:27.800
if I became rich one day.

19:28.560 --> 19:29.960
If I were richer than them…

19:32.080 --> 19:34.240
I'd treat them the way they treat me.

19:42.920 --> 19:46.920
"Here, Nana, I just wired you money.

19:47.000 --> 19:48.520
Pick up my dog's shit."

19:50.840 --> 19:54.080
"Here, Tubtim, here's a new bag.

19:54.160 --> 19:57.600
Your bag is so frumpy, I just
couldn't stand to look at it anymore."

20:00.560 --> 20:02.960
Or maybe, I'll do the same thing
they do to me.

20:04.160 --> 20:07.120
"Here, I just wired you money.

20:08.040 --> 20:10.560
Thank you for your wonderful friendship."

20:15.480 --> 20:17.600
Wonderful friendship, fuck them.

20:19.440 --> 20:21.400
You can actually do all of that.

20:26.080 --> 20:27.000
Do what?

20:29.600 --> 20:31.600
You can do all the things you just said.

20:32.360 --> 20:33.840
Why wouldn't you do them?

20:37.000 --> 20:38.320
How could I do that?

20:39.200 --> 20:40.600
I don't have money.

20:40.680 --> 20:41.560
I have nothing.

20:41.640 --> 20:42.760
Of course, you can.

20:43.640 --> 20:46.560
If you have something
that rich people are scared of.

20:50.000 --> 20:51.240
What's that?

20:52.800 --> 20:54.040
Their secrets.

20:56.960 --> 20:58.360
Yuri, don't you know…

20:59.760 --> 21:01.640
that Nana and Tubtim,

21:03.240 --> 21:05.440
they have secrets that only they know?

21:17.920 --> 21:20.360
Come on. Let's take a picture. Yuri.

21:21.040 --> 21:22.040
One, two, three.

21:23.040 --> 21:23.960
Great.

21:24.640 --> 21:26.120
Does it look okay?

21:27.360 --> 21:28.800
Yuri, go set the barbecue.

21:30.480 --> 21:31.760
Nanno, get some water.

21:31.840 --> 21:34.280
Those two keep something on a laptop.

21:35.920 --> 21:38.360
That laptop is in Nana's house,
in her room.

21:39.720 --> 21:41.960
But she's never let me see what's on it.

21:47.720 --> 21:49.600
It really shouldn't be too hard.

21:50.400 --> 21:55.160
Just do one thing. You just have to keep
those two distracted while I find it.

21:57.000 --> 21:58.520
-What do you think?
-Can you believe it?

21:58.600 --> 21:59.480
Oh, no!

21:59.560 --> 22:00.680
I'm sorry.

22:01.240 --> 22:02.680
Nanno.

22:02.760 --> 22:04.840
Do you want me to grab you a new shirt?

22:05.640 --> 22:06.720
Make it quick.

22:07.840 --> 22:09.200
My shirt's all wet.

22:14.120 --> 22:15.480
Can you believe it?

22:15.560 --> 22:16.680
She's so clumsy.

22:33.680 --> 22:34.520
Yuri.

22:37.840 --> 22:39.280
This meat is still raw.

23:22.800 --> 23:24.320
Have you wired the money yet?

25:09.760 --> 25:12.360
Hey, you awake?

25:18.680 --> 25:19.920
Sorry, Nanno.

25:22.640 --> 25:23.640
"Sorry"?

25:26.280 --> 25:27.160
I'm really sorry.

25:27.240 --> 25:29.040
You don't have to apologize, Yuri.

25:30.320 --> 25:32.960
You have to stop apologizing
to everybody that comes down here.

25:33.680 --> 25:34.840
Be professional.

25:41.800 --> 25:44.960
Nanno, come on.
Did you really think Yuri would betray us?

25:46.880 --> 25:49.680
What did you think? You thought
you were helping her, didn't you?

25:51.480 --> 25:55.680
This was our plan from the start,
from the very beginning. Understand?

25:57.080 --> 25:59.160
That's why we let you join our clique.

26:05.320 --> 26:09.280
Did it even occur to you?
My laptop didn't even have a password.

26:22.160 --> 26:24.520
You got to play a hero for a minute there.

26:24.600 --> 26:25.480
Did you enjoy it?

26:29.160 --> 26:31.200
You think Yuri would betray us, Nanno?

26:33.000 --> 26:34.240
She wouldn't.

26:35.120 --> 26:37.760
She will always be
a loyal lapdog to her master.

26:53.120 --> 26:54.600
A loyal lapdog?

26:59.800 --> 27:01.520
She's not a loyal lapdog.

27:02.960 --> 27:05.400
She's nothing but a stupid fool.

27:07.680 --> 27:09.720
Yuri, do you want to be
a lapdog all your life?

27:10.320 --> 27:12.120
Bark, bark.

27:13.320 --> 27:15.280
Don't you ever want to be the master?

27:21.320 --> 27:25.040
If you want to be a master,
how about I help you?

27:41.560 --> 27:42.520
What's so funny?

27:43.080 --> 27:45.000
I'm laughing at your stupidity, ladies.

27:46.600 --> 27:48.920
Now then, where's the man
who's going to rape--

27:49.000 --> 27:49.920
Shut up.

27:51.080 --> 27:52.520
I can call him in here right now.

27:53.600 --> 27:54.520
Make it quick.

27:56.120 --> 27:58.360
Do you think I'm scared
to have sex with a guy?

27:58.440 --> 28:00.640
Why don't you keep
your fucking mouth shut?

28:00.720 --> 28:02.720
Your life is in our fucking hands.

28:02.800 --> 28:04.920
Hmm…

28:05.440 --> 28:07.320
I think it's the other way around.

28:07.880 --> 28:12.120
That evidence,
I already uploaded all of it to the cloud.

28:14.080 --> 28:17.080
They weren't just clips
of students getting raped.

28:17.800 --> 28:20.320
There was proof of transactions

28:20.400 --> 28:24.320
with all of your names on them,
Nana, Tubtim,

28:24.400 --> 28:26.160
Yuri, all of you.

28:26.240 --> 28:28.200
So, just do what you want to do.

28:39.000 --> 28:40.720
What the fuck is wrong with you?

28:42.280 --> 28:43.520
Shut up!

28:45.440 --> 28:46.480
I said shut up!

28:50.240 --> 28:51.640
She said shut the fuck up!

28:52.560 --> 28:54.880
Yuri! Do something! Stop her!

28:54.960 --> 28:56.520
-What do you want?
-Shut her up!

28:57.840 --> 28:59.840
I'll pay you. How much? 20,000 enough?

29:00.800 --> 29:02.520
-I'll give you 20K too.
-40,000!

29:02.600 --> 29:05.040
Just do it now! Don't just stand there!

29:05.120 --> 29:07.360
Make her shut up! Hurry up!

29:08.360 --> 29:09.760
Go on!

29:10.400 --> 29:11.480
Shut her up.

29:16.080 --> 29:18.000
Fuck you, I can't do it!

29:19.280 --> 29:20.320
Move!

30:32.640 --> 30:33.520
Yuri.

30:34.960 --> 30:36.920
Take care of her dead body, will you?

30:38.360 --> 30:41.520
Put her in a tub.
And make it look like suicide.

30:46.000 --> 30:47.280
What are you waiting for?

30:51.400 --> 30:52.680
You two

30:52.760 --> 30:54.880
have to get rid of her body yourselves…

30:59.240 --> 31:01.360
now that I have proof
that you killed someone.

31:08.160 --> 31:10.800
Yuri, are you trying to blackmail us?

31:11.480 --> 31:12.880
Don't cross the line.

31:16.680 --> 31:19.080
Since the moment we became friends…

31:21.640 --> 31:23.760
you treated me like some kind of victim.

31:25.200 --> 31:26.480
So I let you.

31:32.120 --> 31:33.920
You like throwing money at me…

31:36.240 --> 31:37.520
so I let you.

31:41.520 --> 31:44.320
You had me play some innocent girl
to lure people here…

31:45.200 --> 31:46.440
and I did it.

31:49.440 --> 31:51.920
You wanted me to be your loyal lapdog…

31:53.680 --> 31:54.800
and I did it.

31:58.680 --> 32:00.560
Is there a line I didn't cross?

32:08.880 --> 32:11.760
Nanno told me that I should find a way
to take you down,

32:13.680 --> 32:15.480
but that was always my plan.

32:19.520 --> 32:20.600
We're ready.

32:34.320 --> 32:35.320
Bitch.

32:36.840 --> 32:38.760
Before we start to have some fun,

32:40.280 --> 32:42.160
why don't you take care of her body?

32:43.560 --> 32:46.160
Put her in a tub
and make it look like a suicide.

32:46.840 --> 32:47.920
Do it.

32:55.000 --> 32:56.720
Do it, Nana, Tubtim.

33:03.160 --> 33:04.000
Yuri…

33:05.840 --> 33:06.920
I'm begging you.

33:08.640 --> 33:10.760
You're used to barking orders.

33:10.840 --> 33:12.520
Now, it's your turn to take them.

33:13.640 --> 33:16.360
Please, don't hurt us. I'm begging you.

33:16.440 --> 33:18.080
I said get rid of her!

33:24.720 --> 33:25.960
Do it.

34:00.040 --> 34:01.320
How much do you want?

34:02.720 --> 34:03.800
What do you think?

34:03.880 --> 34:05.240
A hundred thousand.

34:07.200 --> 34:09.400
Is that really enough for your freedom?

34:09.960 --> 34:11.040
A million?

34:11.640 --> 34:13.520
You think freedom is that cheap?

34:14.080 --> 34:15.120
Ten million.

34:16.920 --> 34:18.720
How much do you want?

34:24.160 --> 34:26.040
What you did to other people…

34:28.000 --> 34:29.760
it can't be paid back with money.

34:32.560 --> 34:34.200
It has to be paid for with pain.

34:36.520 --> 34:38.040
How many videos have you made?

34:39.560 --> 34:41.600
How many people have you hurt?

34:42.880 --> 34:45.760
One, two, three, four… whoa.

34:45.840 --> 34:47.280
There are too many to count.

34:51.160 --> 34:53.160
You can have fun with them all you want.

34:53.240 --> 34:54.680
I just want a short video.

34:54.760 --> 34:56.080
You can't do that!

35:03.680 --> 35:04.880
Why can't I?

35:11.200 --> 35:12.480
That sounds familiar?

35:16.840 --> 35:19.760
It's what I said to you in this room
the day you filmed me.

35:38.560 --> 35:40.280
What did you say to me that day?

35:44.840 --> 35:47.360
"This is your fault. Don't be so stupid."

35:48.640 --> 35:49.840
Hey, guys. They're all yours.

35:52.000 --> 35:53.480
-Please, no.
-Let me go.

35:53.560 --> 35:54.400
-No!
-Please!

35:55.560 --> 35:56.480
No!

36:29.280 --> 36:30.320
Hmm.

36:35.080 --> 36:36.480
Thank you, Nanno.

36:37.280 --> 36:39.160
Thanks for trying to help me.

36:40.840 --> 36:42.200
But I'm sorry…

36:43.520 --> 36:45.320
I didn't really need your help.

36:46.360 --> 36:47.920
I just needed victims.

36:50.240 --> 36:51.120
Well?

36:51.960 --> 36:53.680
Did you think I was stupid?

36:56.480 --> 36:57.920
I put up…

36:59.080 --> 37:01.000
with all the pain and torture,

37:01.640 --> 37:03.760
everything they did to me,

37:03.840 --> 37:06.000
because I was waiting to get my revenge.

37:13.760 --> 37:16.040
I didn't trick you to get me the laptop

37:18.000 --> 37:20.000
because I wanted to know what was on it.

37:22.240 --> 37:24.720
I just wanted
all their clients' information

37:25.600 --> 37:27.760
so I can blackmail them myself.

37:32.160 --> 37:33.080
Get it?

37:34.400 --> 37:36.360
Their whole business is mine now.

37:45.320 --> 37:46.760
I'll wire you the money.

39:33.440 --> 39:35.160
If you weren't so stupid…

39:36.360 --> 39:38.360
it could've been much more interesting.

39:49.720 --> 39:52.000
Friendship comes with a price.

39:52.720 --> 39:55.720
Sometimes, it costs more than you think.

39:56.440 --> 39:58.800
The price can be so high

39:59.360 --> 40:01.800
that you may end up paying for it
with your life.
